egin="00:03.210" end="00:03.440">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夫</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:03.440" end="00:03.760">ぶ</span></span></span> <span begin="00:03.760" end="00:04.120">お</span><span begin="00:04.120" end="00:04.465">ど</span><span begin="00:04.465" end="00:04.700">け</span><span begin="00:04.700" end="00:05.240">て</span><span begin="00:05.240" end="00:05.420">み</span><span begin="00:05.420" end="00:05.900">せ</span><span begin="00:05.900" end="00:06.120">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">僕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:06.120" end="00:06.600">ぼ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:06.600" end="00:06.820">く</span></span></span><span begin="00:06.820" end="00:07.340">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">没关系 没关系 做着鬼脸的我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">daijōbu daijōbu odokete miseru boku wa</span></p><p begin="00:07.680" end="00:14.440" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">小</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:07.680" end="00:08.300">ち</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:08.300" end="00:08.380">い</span></span></span><span begin="00:08.380" end="00:08.780">さ</span><span begin="00:08.780" end="00:08.930">な</span><span begin="00:08.930" end="00:09.314" ttx:rubyGroup="1" ttx:rubyText="circus" ttx:rubyTimes="00:08.930,00:09.680">サー</span><span begin="00:09.314" end="00:09.523" ttx:rubyGroup="1">カ</span><span begin="00:09.523" end="00:09.680" ttx:rubyGroup="1">ス</span><span begin="00:09.680" end="00:10.200">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">名</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:10.540" end="00:10.940">な</span></span></span><span begin="00:10.940" end="00:11.300">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">無</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:11.300" end="00:11.680">な</span></span></span><span begin="00:11.680" end="00:12.120">き</span><span begin="00:12.120" end="00:12.410">ピ</span><span begin="00:12.410" end="00:12.640">エ</span><span begin="00:12.640" end="00:14.440">ロ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">只是小马戏团中的无名小丑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">chiisana sākasu no na mo naki piero</span></p><p begin="00:38.460" end="00:42.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">真</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:38.460" end="00:38.650">ま</span></span></span><span begin="00:38.650" end="00:38.820">ん</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">丸</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:38.820" end="00:39.060">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:39.060" end="00:39.330">る</span></span></span><span begin="00:39.330" end="00:39.540">い</span><span begin="00:39.540" end="00:39.760">お</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">月</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:39.760" end="00:40.220">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:40.220" end="00:40.300">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">様</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:40.300" end="00:40.560">さ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:40.560" end="00:41.060">ま</span></span></span><span begin="00:41.060" end="00:41.280">み</span><span begin="00:41.280" end="00:41.560">た</span><span begin="00:41.560" end="00:41.680">い</span><span begin="00:41.680" end="00:42.460">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">站在像是满月一样的球上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">manmarui otsukisama mitai na</span></p><p begin="00:43.580" end="00:48.240" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:43.580" end="00:44.100" ttx:rubyGroup="1" ttx:rubyText="ball" ttx:rubyTimes="00:43.580,00:44.300">ボー</span><span begin="00:44.100" end="00:44.300" ttx:rubyGroup="1">ル</span><span begin="00:44.300" end="00:44.660">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">上</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:44.660" end="00:44.960">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:44.960" end="00:45.400">え</span></span></span> <span begin="00:45.400" end="00:45.600" ttx:rubyGroup="2" ttx:rubyText="balance" ttx:rubyTimes="00:45.400,00:46.920">バ</span><span begin="00:45.600" end="00:46.180" ttx:rubyGroup="2">ラ</span><span begin="00:46.180" end="00:46.540" ttx:rubyGroup="2">ン</span><span begin="00:46.540" end="00:46.920" ttx:rubyGroup="2">ス</span><span begin="00:46.920" end="00:47.140">を</span><span begin="00:47.140" end="00:47.500">とっ</span><span begin="00:47.500" end="00:48.240">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">保持着平衡</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">bōru no ue baransu o totte</span></p><p begin="00:50.060" end="00:53.600" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">派</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:50.060" end="00:50.460">は</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">手</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:50.460" end="00:50.640">で</span></span></span><span begin="00:50.640" end="00:51.120">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">転</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:51.120" end="00:51.320">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:51.320" end="00:51.660">ろ</span></span></span><span begin="00:51.660" end="00:51.860">ん</span><span begin="00:51.860" end="00:52.060">だ</span><span begin="00:52.060" end="00:52.540">り</span><span begin="00:52.540" end="00:52.840">し</span><span begin="00:52.840" end="00:53.200">ちゃっ</span><span begin="00:53.200" end="00:53.600">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">再华丽地跌落下来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hade ni korondari shichatte</span></p><p begin="00:55.020" end="00:59.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">笑</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:55.020" end="00:55.360">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:55.360" end="00:55.560">ら</span></span></span><span begin="00:55.560" end="00:55.780">わ</span><span begin="00:55.780" end="00:55.980">れ</span><span begin="00:55.980" end="00:56.140">る</span><span begin="00:56.140" end="00:56.320">の</span><span begin="00:56.320" end="00:56.840">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">僕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:56.840" end="00:57.180">ぼ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:57.180" end="00:57.560">く</span></span></span><span begin="00:57.560" end="00:57.740">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">仕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:57.740" end="00:58.140">し</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">事</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:58.140" end="00:58.360">ご</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:58.360" end="00:59.000">と</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">任人发笑便是我的工作</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">warawareru no ga boku no shigoto</span></p><p begin="01:01.442" end="01:06.180" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">客</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:01.442" end="01:01.680">きゃ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:01.680" end="01:01.800">く</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">席</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:01.800" end="01:02.020">せ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:02.020" end="01:02.560">き</span></span></span><span begin="01:02.560" end="01:02.900">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">泣</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:02.900" end="01:03.120">な</span></span></span><span begin="01:03.120" end="01:03.260">い</span><span begin="01:03.260" end="01:03.440">て</span><span begin="01:03.440" end="01:03.740">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:03.960" end="01:04.380">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:04.380" end="01:04.600">み</span></span></span><span begin="01:04.600" end="01:04.940">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:04.940" end="01:05.300">み</span></span></span><span begin="01:05.300" end="01:05.460">つ</span><span begin="01:05.460" end="01:05.660">け</span><span begin="01:05.660" end="01:06.180">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">看见了在观众席上悲伤的你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kyakuseki ni naiteru kimi o mitsuketa</span></p><p begin="01:06.463" end="01:10.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="01:06.463" end="01:06.800">そ</span><span begin="01:06.800" end="01:06.960">ん</span><span begin="01:06.960" end="01:07.300">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">悲</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:07.300" end="01:07.640">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:07.640" end="01:07.800">な</span></span></span><span begin="01:07.800" end="01:08.080">し</span><span begin="01:08.080" end="01:08.360">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">顔</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:08.360" end="01:08.540">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:08.540" end="01:09.040">お</span></span></span><span begin="01:09.040" end="01:09.360">は</span><span begin="01:09.360" end="01:09.760">し</span><span begin="01:09.760" end="01:10.000">な</span><span begin="01:10.000" end="01:10.320">い</span><span begin="01:10.320" end="01:10.520">で</span><span begin="01:10.520" end="01:10.860">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">请不要露出那样的表情吖</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sonna kanashii kao wa shinaide yo</span></p><p begin="01:12.240" end="01:17.180" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="01:12.240" end="01:12.540" ttx:rubyGroup="1" ttx:rubyText="papa" ttx:rubyTimes="01:12.240,01:12.740">パ</span><span begin="01:12.540" end="01:12.740" ttx:rubyGroup="1">パ</span><span begin="01:12.740" end="01:12.960">も</span><span begin="01:12.960" end="01:13.320" ttx:rubyGroup="2" ttx:rubyText="mama" ttx:rubyTimes="01:12.960,01:13.540">マ</span><span begin="01:13.320" end="01:13.540" ttx:rubyGroup="2">マ</span><span begin="01:13.540" end="01:13.940">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">知</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:13.940" end="01:14.240">し</span></span></span><span begin="01:14.240" end="01:14.560">ら</span><span begin="01:14.560" end="01:14.720">な</span><span begin="01:14.720" end="01:14.880">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:15.100" end="01:15.460">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:15.460" end="01:15.700">み</span></span></span><span begin="01:15.700" end="01:15.880">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">涙</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:15.880" end="01:16.260">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:16.260" end="01:16.480">み</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:16.480" end="01:16.980">だ</span></span></span><span begin="01:16.980" end="01:17.180">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">爸爸妈妈都没能发现的眼泪</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">papa mo mama mo shiranai kimi no namida ni</span></p><p begin="01:17.180" end="01:23.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">僕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:17.180" end="01:17.500">ぼ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:17.500" end="01:17.680">く</span></span></span><span begin="01:17.680" end="01:18.080">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">気</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:18.540" end="01:18.760">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">付</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:18.760" end="01:19.100">づ</span></span></span><span begin="01:19.100" end="01:19.300">い</span><span begin="01:19.300" end="01:19.660">た</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">拭っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:19.860" end="01:20.220">ぬ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:20.220" end="01:20.660">ぐ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:20.660" end="01:20.940">っ</span></span></span><span begin="01:20.940" end="01:21.380">て</span><span begin="01:21.380" end="01:21.720">あ</span><span begin="01:21.720" end="01:22.600">げ</span><span begin="01:22.600" end="01:22.820">な</span><span begin="01:22.820" end="01:23.000">く</span><span begin="01:23.000" end="01:23.860">ちゃ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">就请让我帮你拭去吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">boku wa kizuita nugutte agenakucha</span></p><p begin="01:24.600" end="01:30.820" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">『大</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:24.600" end="01:24.860">だ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:24.860" end="01:24.980">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">丈</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:24.980" end="01:25.340">じょ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:25.340" end="01:25.700">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夫、</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:25.700" end="01:26.080">ぶ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">大</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:26.080" end="01:26.320">だ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:26.320" end="01:26.420">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">丈</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:26.420" end="01:26.630">じょ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:26.630" end="01:26.880">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夫</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:26.880" end="01:27.180">ぶ</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">痛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:27.180" end="01:27.560">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:27.560" end="01:27.900">た</span></span></span><span begin="01:27.900" end="01:28.120">く</span><span begin="01:28.120" end="01:28.600">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">痒</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:28.600" end="01:28.840">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:28.840" end="01:29.260">ゆ</span></span></span><span begin="01:29.260" end="01:29.360">く</span><span begin="01:29.360" end="01:29.580">も</span><span begin="01:29.580" end="01:29.840">な</span><span begin="01:29.840" end="01:29.960">い</span><span begin="01:29.960" end="01:30.060">ん</span><span begin="01:30.060" end="01:30.240">だ</span><span begin="01:30.240" end="01:30.820">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">没关系 没关系 这种程度不痛不痒哦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">daijōbu daijōbu itaku mo kayuku mo nai n da yo</span></p><p begin="01:31.120" end="01:35.980" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:31.120" end="01:31.520">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:31.520" end="01:31.880">み</span></span></span><span begin="01:31.880" end="01:32.240">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">笑っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:32.240" end="01:32.580">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:32.580" end="01:32.860">ら</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:32.860" end="01:33.140">っ</span></span></span><span begin="01:33.140" end="01:33.720">て</span><span begin="01:34.020" end="01:34.440">く</span><span begin="01:34.440" end="01:34.840">れ</span><span begin="01:34.840" end="01:35.380">る</span><span begin="01:35.380" end="01:35.580">な</span><span begin="01:35.580" end="01:35.980">ら』</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">只要你能露出笑颜的话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kimi ga waratte kureru nara</span></p><p begin="01:36.280" end="01:42.480" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:36.280" end="01:36.470">ダ</span><span begin="01:36.470" end="01:36.633">イ</span><span begin="01:36.633" end="01:37.040">ジョ</span><span begin="01:37.040" end="01:37.380">ウ</span><span begin="01:37.380" end="01:37.740">ブ、</span><span begin="01:37.740" end="01:37.910">ダ</span><span begin="01:37.910" end="01:38.054">イ</span><span begin="01:38.054" end="01:38.330">ジョ</span><span begin="01:38.330" end="01:38.540">ウ</span><span begin="01:38.540" end="01:38.760">ブ</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">無</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:38.760" end="01:39.220">ぶ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">様</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:39.220" end="01:39.620">ざ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:39.620" end="01:39.800">ま</span></span></span><span begin="01:39.800" end="01:40.300">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">転</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:40.300" end="01:40.520">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:40.520" end="01:41.040">ろ</span></span></span><span begin="01:41.040" end="01:41.240">ぶ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">僕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:41.240" end="01:41.760">ぼ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:41.760" end="01:41.960">く</span></span></span><span begin="01:41.960" end="01:42.480">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">没关系 没关系 蹩脚跌下的我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">daijōbu daijōbu buzama ni korobu boku wa</span></p><p begin="01:42.840" end="01:48.940" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">小</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:42.840" end="01:43.240">ち</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:43.240" end="01:43.560">い</span></span></span><span begin="01:43.560" end="01:44.000">さ</span><span begin="01:44.000" end="01:44.180">な</span><span begin="01:44.180" end="01:44.560" ttx:rubyGroup="1" ttx:rubyText="circus" ttx:rubyTimes="01:44.180,01:44.920">サー</span><span begin="01:44.560" end="01:44.800" ttx:rubyGroup="1">カ</span><span begin="01:44.800" end="01:44.920" ttx:rubyGroup="1">ス</span><span begin="01:44.920" end="01:45.480">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">玉</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:45.780" end="01:46.260">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:46.260" end="01:46.600">ま</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">乗</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:46.600" end="01:46.980">の</span></span></span><span begin="01:46.980" end="01:47.340">り</span><span begin="01:47.340" end="01:47.740">ピ</span><span begin="01:47.740" end="01:47.900">エ</span><span begin="01:47.900" end="01:48.940">ロ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">只是小马戏团中踩着球的小丑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">chiisana sākasu no tamanori piero</span></p><p begin="01:53.800" end="01:57.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">泣</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:53.800" end="01:54.220">な</span></span></span><span begin="01:54.220" end="01:54.440">き</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">止</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:54.440" end="01:54.940">や</span></span></span><span begin="01:54.940" end="01:55.220">ま</span><span begin="01:55.220" end="01:55.520">な</span><span begin="01:55.520" end="01:55.720">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:55.720" end="01:55.940">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:55.940" end="01:56.260">み</span></span></span><span begin="01:56.260" end="01:56.500">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:56.500" end="01:56.720">い</span></span></span><span begin="01:56.720" end="01:56.800">う</span><span begin="01:56.800" end="01:57.000">ん</span><span begin="01:57.000" end="01:57.460">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">你不停地哭着说</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nakiyamanai kimi ga iu n da</span></p><p begin="01:58.900" end="02:03.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:58.900" end="01:59.200">「あ</span><span begin="01:59.200" end="01:59.500">な</span><span begin="01:59.500" end="01:59.680">た</span><span begin="01:59.680" end="02:00.040">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">嘘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:00.040" end="02:00.240">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:00.240" end="02:00.720">そ</span></span></span><span begin="02:00.720" end="02:01.100">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">悲</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:01.100" end="02:01.480">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:01.480" end="02:01.693">な</span></span></span><span begin="02:01.693" end="02:01.880">し</span><span begin="02:01.880" end="02:02.440">い</span><span begin="02:02.440" end="02:02.760">の」っ</span><span begin="02:02.760" end="02:03.160">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">“你的谎话令人悲伤”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">anata no uso ga kanashii no tte</span></p><p begin="02:05.414" end="02:08.980" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">『嘘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:05.414" end="02:05.760">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:05.760" end="02:06.020">そ</span></span></span><span begin="02:06.020" end="02:06.360">な</span><span begin="02:06.360" end="02:06.500">ん</span><span begin="02:06.500" end="02:06.680">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">一</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:06.680" end="02:06.820">ひ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:06.820" end="02:07.180">と</span></span></span><span begin="02:07.180" end="02:07.300">つ</span><span begin="02:07.300" end="02:07.580">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">吐</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:07.580" end="02:07.800">つ</span></span></span><span begin="02:07.800" end="02:07.980">い</span><span begin="02:07.980" end="02:08.220">て</span><span begin="02:08.220" end="02:08.460">な</span><span begin="02:08.460" end="02:08.640">い</span><span begin="02:08.640" end="02:08.980">よ』</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">“才不是说慌什么的呢”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">uso nante hitotsu mo tsuitenai yo</span></p><p begin="02:10.283" end="02:14.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="02:10.283" end="02:10.700">そ</span><span begin="02:10.700" end="02:11.000">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:11.000" end="02:11.180">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:11.180" end="02:11.500">と</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">葉</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:11.500" end="02:11.720">ば</span></span></span><span begin="02:11.720" end="02:12.240">に</span><span begin="02:12.240" end="02:12.600">ま</span><span begin="02:12.600" end="02:12.960">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">泣</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:12.960" end="02:13.160">な</span></span></span><span begin="02:13.160" end="02:13.520">き</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">出</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:13.520" end="02:13.680">だ</span></span></span><span begin="02:13.680" end="02:13.840">し</span><span begin="02:13.840" end="02:14.160">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">听了这句话你又哭了起来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sono kotoba ni mata nakidashita</span></p><p begin="02:51.160" end="02:55.920" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">「客</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:51.160" end="02:51.400">きゃ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:51.400" end="02:51.540">く</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">席</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:51.540" end="02:51.740">せ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:51.740" end="02:52.240">き</span></span></span><span begin="02:52.240" end="02:52.600">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:52.600" end="02:52.880">み</span></span></span><span begin="02:52.880" end="02:53.160">せ</span><span begin="02:53.160" end="02:53.340">な</span><span begin="02:53.340" end="02:53.540">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">仮</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:53.860" end="02:54.100">か</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">面</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:54.100" end="02:54.300">め</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:54.300" end="02:54.460">ん</span></span></span><span begin="02:54.460" end="02:54.620">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">下</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:54.620" end="02:55.180">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:55.180" end="02:55.440">た</span></span></span><span begin="02:55.440" end="02:55.920">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">“观众们看不到的面具之下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kyakuseki ni misenai kamen no shita no</span></p><p begin="02:56.220" end="03:00.620" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="02:56.220" end="02:56.520">あ</span><span begin="02:56.520" end="02:56.800">な</span><span begin="02:56.800" end="02:57.020">た</span><span begin="02:57.020" end="02:57.340">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">隠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:57.340" end="02:57.500">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:57.500" end="02:57.820">く</span></span></span><span begin="02:57.820" end="02:58.000">し</span><span begin="02:58.000" end="02:58.240">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">素</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:58.240" end="02:58.700">す</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">顔</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:58.700" end="02:59.020">が</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:59.020" end="02:59.360">お</span></span></span><span begin="02:59.360" end="02:59.700">を</span><span begin="02:59.700" end="02:59.940">み</span><span begin="02:59.940" end="03:00.200">せ</span><span begin="03:00.200" end="03:00.620">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">你藏起来的真实心意就请与我分享吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">anata ga kakushita sugao o misete</span></p><p begin="03:01.900" end="03:07.700" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">怪</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:01.900" end="03:02.160">け</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">我</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:02.160" end="03:02.360">が</span></span></span><span begin="03:02.360" end="03:02.620">し</span><span begin="03:02.620" end="03:02.980">た</span><span begin="03:02.980" end="03:03.200">と</span><span begin="03:03.200" end="03:03.720">き</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">痛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:03.720" end="03:03.920">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:03.920" end="03:04.085">た</span></span></span><span begin="03:04.085" end="03:04.260">いっ</span><span begin="03:04.260" end="03:04.600">て</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">辛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:04.780" end="03:05.100">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:05.100" end="03:05.360">ら</span></span></span><span begin="03:05.360" end="03:05.600">い</span><span begin="03:05.600" end="03:05.940">と</span><span begin="03:05.940" end="03:06.160">き</span><span begin="03:06.160" end="03:06.700">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">喚</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:06.700" end="03:06.860">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:06.860" end="03:07.080">め</span></span></span><span begin="03:07.080" end="03:07.220">い</span><span begin="03:07.220" end="03:07.700">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">要是受伤就诉说痛楚 要是难过就放声哭泣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kega shita toki itai tte tsurai toki wa wameite</span></p><p begin="03:08.080" end="03:15.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">恥</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:08.080" end="03:08.440">は</span></span></span><span begin="03:08.440" end="03:08.820">ず</span><span begin="03:08.820" end="03:08.980">か</span><span begin="03:08.980" end="03:09.270">し</span><span begin="03:09.270" end="03:09.560">い</span><span begin="03:09.560" end="03:09.920">こ</span><span begin="03:09.920" end="03:10.380">と</span><span begin="03:10.680" end="03:11.420">は</span><span begin="03:11.420" end="03:11.910">な</span><span begin="03:11.910" end="03:12.160">い</span><span begin="03:12.160" end="03:12.380">ん</span><span begin="03:12.380" end="03:12.540">だ</span><span begin="03:12.540" end="03:12.720">か</span><span begin="03:12.720" end="03:15.280">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">没什么好害羞的啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hazukashii koto wa nai n dakara</span></p><p begin="03:19.240" end="03:25.360" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">大</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:19.240" end="03:19.500">だ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:19.500" end="03:19.620">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">丈</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:19.620" end="03:20.120">じょ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:20.120" end="03:20.260">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夫、</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:20.260" end="03:20.720">ぶ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">大</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:20.720" end="03:20.960">だ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:20.960" end="03:21.080">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">丈</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:21.080" end="03:21.280">じょ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:21.280" end="03:21.480">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夫</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:21.480" end="03:21.760">ぶ</span></span></span> <span begin="03:21.760" end="03:22.160" ttx:rubyGroup="1" ttx:rubyText="う|ま" ttx:rubyTimes="03:21.760,03:22.160 03:22.160,03:22.420">上</span><span begin="03:22.160" end="03:22.420" ttx:rubyGroup="1">手</span><span begin="03:22.420" end="03:22.560">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">笑</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:22.560" end="03:22.760">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:22.760" end="03:23.260">ら</span></span></span><span begin="03:23.260" end="03:23.460">え</span><span begin="03:23.460" end="03:23.860">な</span><span begin="03:23.860" end="03:23.980">く</span><span begin="03:23.980" end="03:24.220">て</span><span begin="03:24.220" end="03:24.390">い</span><span begin="03:24.390" end="03:24.560">い</span><span begin="03:24.560" end="03:24.700">ん</span><span begin="03:24.700" end="03:24.920">だ</span><span begin="03:24.920" end="03:25.360">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">没关系 没关系 不去勉强欢笑也可以的啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">daijōbu daijōbu umaku waraenakute ii n da yo</span></p><p begin="03:25.720" end="03:30.480" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="03:25.720" end="03:25.960">も</span><span begin="03:25.960" end="03:26.140">う</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">二</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:26.140" end="03:26.320">に</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">度</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:26.320" end="03:26.880">ど</span></span></span><span begin="03:26.880" end="03:27.140">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">嘘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:27.140" end="03:27.380">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:27.380" end="03:28.002">そ</span></span></span><span begin="03:28.002" end="03:28.400">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">吐</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:28.620" end="03:29.020">つ</span></span></span><span begin="03:29.020" end="03:29.440">け</span><span begin="03:29.440" end="03:29.660">な</span><span begin="03:29.660" end="03:29.850">い</span><span begin="03:29.850" end="03:29.970">よ</span><span begin="03:29.970" end="03:30.060">う</span><span begin="03:30.060" end="03:30.480">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">只希望你别再说谎</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mō nido to uso o tsukenai yō ni</span></p><p begin="03:30.820" end="03:36.980" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">大</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:30.820" end="03:31.060">だ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:31.060" end="03:31.220">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">丈</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:31.220" end="03:31.460">じょ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:31.460" end="03:31.700">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夫、</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:31.700" end="03:32.000">ぶ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">大</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:32.280" end="03:32.580">だ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:32.580" end="03:32.680">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">丈</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:32.680" end="03:32.870">じょ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:32.870" end="03:33.060">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夫</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:33.060" end="03:33.260">ぶ</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">堪</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:33.400" end="03:33.800">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:33.800" end="03:33.980">ら</span></span></span><span begin="03:33.980" end="03:34.160">え</span><span begin="03:34.160" end="03:34.340">た</span><span begin="03:34.340" end="03:34.760">り</span><span begin="03:34.760" end="03:35.040">し</span><span begin="03:35.040" end="03:35.460">な</span><span begin="03:35.460" end="03:35.560">く</span><span begin="03:35.560" end="03:35.780">て</span><span begin="03:35.780" end="03:35.970">い</span><span begin="03:35.970" end="03:36.160">い</span><span begin="03:36.160" end="03:36.280">ん</span><span begin="03:36.280" end="03:36.520">だ</span><span begin="03:36.520" end="03:36.980">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">没关系 没关系 不去苦苦忍耐也可以的啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">daijōbu daijōbu koraetari shinakute ii n da yo</span></p><p begin="03:37.340" end="03:42.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">私</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:37.340" end="03:37.740">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:37.740" end="03:38.020">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:38.020" end="03:38.420">し</span></span></span><span begin="03:38.420" end="03:38.740">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">一</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:38.740" end="03:39.140">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:39.140" end="03:39.280">っ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">緒</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:39.280" end="03:39.480">しょ</span></span></span><span begin="03:39.480" end="03:39.880">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">泣</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:40.200" end="03:40.420">な</span></span></span><span begin="03:40.420" end="03:40.560">い</span><span begin="03:40.560" end="03:40.920">て</span><span begin="03:40.920" end="03:41.480">あ</span><span begin="03:41.480" end="03:41.680">げ</span><span begin="03:41.680" end="03:42.100">る」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我会和你一起抚去悲伤</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">watashi mo issho ni naite ageru</span></p><p begin="03:42.360" end="03:48.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">大</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:42.360" end="03:42.640">だ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:42.640" end="03:42.760">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">丈</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:42.760" end="03:43.320">じょ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:43.320" end="03:43.480">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夫</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:43.480" end="03:43.840">ぶ</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">大</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:43.840" end="03:44.080">だ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:44.080" end="03:44.180">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">丈</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:44.180" end="03:44.380">じょ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:44.380" end="03:44.580">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夫</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:44.580" end="03:44.740">ぶ</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:44.880" end="03:45.300">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:45.300" end="03:45.620">み</span></span></span><span begin="03:45.620" end="03:45.820">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:45.820" end="03:46.300">み</span></span></span><span begin="03:46.300" end="03:46.500">つ</span><span begin="03:46.500" end="03:47.000">け</span><span begin="03:47.000" end="03:47.200">て</span><span begin="03:47.200" end="03:47.720">く</span><span begin="03:47.720" end="03:47.940">れ</span><span begin="03:47.940" end="03:48.500">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">没关系 没关系 你有再次帮我寻回</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">daijōbu daijōbu kimi ga mitsukete kureta</span></p><p begin="03:48.800" end="03:53.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">忘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:48.800" end="03:49.093">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:49.093" end="03:49.560">す</span></span></span><span begin="03:49.560" end="03:49.920">れ</span><span begin="03:49.920" end="03:50.120">か</span><span begin="03:50.120" end="03:50.480">け</span><span begin="03:50.480" end="03:50.820">て</span><span begin="03:50.820" end="03:51.400">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">僕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:51.680" end="03:52.040">ぼ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:52.040" end="03:52.420">く</span></span></span><span begin="03:52.420" end="03:52.920">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">顔</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:52.920" end="03:53.180">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:53.180" end="03:53.560">お</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我快要忘记的自己的脸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">wasurekaketeta boku no kao</span></p><p begin="03:53.860" end="04:01.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">「大</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:53.860" end="03:54.140">だ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:54.140" end="03:54.240">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">丈</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:54.240" end="03:54.590">じょ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:54.590" end="03:54.940">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夫、</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:54.940" end="03:55.320">ぶ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">大</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:55.320" end="03:55.560">だ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:55.560" end="03:55.660">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">丈</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:55.660" end="03:56.000">じょ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:56.000" end="03:56.060">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夫」</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:56.060" end="03:56.240">ぶ</span></span></span> <span begin="03:56.240" end="03:56.760">そ</span><span begin="03:56.760" end="03:57.120">れ</span><span begin="03:57.120" end="03:57.500">は</span><span begin="03:57.500" end="03:57.860">ま</span><span begin="03:57.860" end="03:58.180">る</span><span begin="03:58.180" end="03:58.540">で</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">魔</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:58.540" end="03:58.900">ま</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">法</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:58.900" end="03:59.260">ほ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="03:59.260" end="04:00.320">う</span></span></span><span begin="04:00.320" end="04:00.620">の</span><span begin="04:00.620" end="04:00.800">よ</span><span begin="04:00.800" end="04:00.900">う</span><span begin="04:00.900" end="04:01.640">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">没关系 没关系 那就像是魔法一样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">daijōbu daijōbu sore wa marude mahō no yō da</span></p><p begin="04:02.100" end="04:13.480" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="04:02.100" end="04:02.520">ほ</span><span begin="04:02.520" end="04:02.960">ら</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">嘘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:03.200" end="04:03.560">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:03.560" end="04:03.920">そ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">吐</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:03.920" end="04:04.300">つ</span></span></span><span begin="04:04.300" end="04:04.700">き</span><span begin="04:04.700" end="04:05.020">ピ</span><span begin="04:05.020" end="04:05.220">エ</span><span begin="04:05.220" end="04:06.340">ロ</span><span begin="04:07.860" end="04:08.110">は</span><span begin="04:08.110" end="04:08.340">も</span><span begin="04:08.340" end="04:08.700">う</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">消</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="04:08.980" end="04:09.460">き</span></span></span><span begin="04:09.460" end="04:09.920">え</span><span begin="04:09.920" end="04:10.360">て</span><span begin="04:10.360" end="04:10.620">い</span><span begin="04:10.620" end="04:10.920">な</span><span begin="04:10.920" end="04:11.060">く</span><span begin="04:11.060" end="04:11.460">なっ</span><span begin="04:11.460" end="04:13.480">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">看啊 那个说谎的小丑 已经不见了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hora usotsuki piero wa mō kiete inaku natta</span></p></div></body></tt>